# V2-10 (e) the wetlands on the huge planet of seed 7, each at a place in its realm (`x=`, `z=`):
# the Old World's fen of reeds, cattails, alder and willow with its pools and geese, and the same
# from above (the lilies on the pools); a cool bog; Africa's papyrus swamp with hippos; the
# Amazon's swamp of moriche palms with capybaras; tropical Asia's floodplain with water buffalo;
# then their animals, close. `hearth --screenshot-list tools/shots/v210_wetlands.shots`
